    <briefdescription>
<para>Some generic instructions have operands that can be mapped to either fprb or gprb e.g. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>for G_LOAD we consider only operand 0 as ambiguous, operand 1 is always gprb since it is a pointer. This class provides containers for MI&apos;s ambiguous: DefUses : MachineInstrs that use one of MI&apos;s ambiguous def operands. UseDefs : MachineInstrs that define MI&apos;s ambiguous use operands. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
